# game/script.rpy:31
translate english start_dd8125ca:

    # "Morphy" "而我甚至可以控制这个物种，让它完成我的期许——\n就像基因传播长久以来控制我们一样。"
    "Morphy" "And the point is, I could control this new species: Have it act to fulfill my goals, \njust as gene transmission has controlled humans."

# game/script.rpy:32
